status: DRAFT
scope: LoA.v13 + LoA.v14 + CSSLv3
owner: Apocky

§ GOAL
  what: CSSL-only LoA/Substrate engine → rich-scene high-refresh action runtime
  why:  proprietary substrate > Odin/Rust/WGSL/wgpu dependency surface

  W! LoA.runtime ∈ CSSL
  W! LoA.engine ∈ CSSL
  W! Substrate.math ∈ CSSL
  W! GPU.kernels ∈ CSSL
  W! host.abi surface owned-by CSSLv3
  N! Odin/Rust runtime path as engine endpoint
  N! CPU framebuffer loop as render path
  N! "working in v14" ⇒ accepted unless reauthored+verified in CSSL

