§ THESIS
  I> CSSL = language+engine+substrate sovereignty boundary
  I> Rust/Odin/WGSL/wgpu = evidence/oracle/bootstrap debt, not architecture
  I> rich scene/high refresh requires GPU-first dataflow + CPU job graph + explicit memory domains
  I> proprietary-better-than-Rust/Odin means:
      typed CPU/GPU/RAM ownership
      effect/capability rows
      deterministic gameplay by construction
      render graph compiled from CSSL facts
      substrate algebra native in compiler IR
      no permanent foreign runtime semantics

§ TARGETS
  target.floor:
    resolution: 2560x1440
    refresh: 144Hz
    frame_budget: 6.944ms
    p99: ≤ 6.944ms
    visible: rich scene + action input + gameplay tick

  target.competitive:
    refresh: 240Hz
    frame_budget: 4.166ms
    sim_tick: 120Hz | 240Hz fixed-step
    input_sample: raw-input ≤ 1ms jitter
    present: mailbox/immediate low-latency mode
    p99.9: tracked ; avg FPS insufficient

  target.hardware.Arc_A770:
    vram: 16GB GDDR6
    bandwidth: ≈560GB/s
    fp32: ≈17.2TFLOP/s
    units: 32 Xe cores + 32 RT units + XMX
    W! renderer saturates GPU before CPU for visual work
    W! CPU feeds GPU via wide task graph, no hot-path single-thread choke

