§ ARCHITECTURE
  L4 LoA.game:
    files: *.cssl only
    owns: gameplay, input mapping, rules, camera, combat, abilities, net/replay policy

  L3 engine.Substrate:
    files: *.cssl only
    owns: render_graph, scene_graph, ECS/data-oriented store, physics, animation, audio, particles, substrate VM

  L2 stdlib.CSSL:
    owns: gpu, window, input, audio, fs, time, thread, simd, math, asset, telemetry
    W! Cap<Gpu> + Cap<Window> + Cap<Input> structural witnesses
    W! effect rows protect host/device/stateful ops

  L1 runtime.host:
    owns: OS ABI, D3D12/Vulkan/LevelZero/Win32/XInput/rawinput direct calls
    W! no LoA dependency on Rust crates/wgpu/ash/windows-rs
    ◐ bootstrap debt allowed only behind replacement milestones

  L0 hardware:
    owns: CPU cores, GPU queues, VRAM, RAM, storage, display
    W! exposed upward as typed capabilities, not ad hoc handles

§ RENDERING
  §R1 forward_compute.mainline
    goal: replace v13 CPU display with CSSL GPU visible frame
    source: engine/render_forward.cssl + stdlib/gpu.cssl + v14 compute lessons
    pipeline:
      depth_prepass.cssl
      light_tile_cull.cssl       # 16x16 or adaptive tiles
      opaque_forward.cssl
      transparent_forward.cssl
      substrate_compute.cssl     # procedural/quadric layer
      post_taa_vrs_tonemap.cssl
      present.cssl
    W! storage_texture writes from CSSL compute kernel
    W! bind groups/layouts generated from CSSL type facts
    W! no per-frame heap allocation
    W! hot-reload compiles CSSL → backend IR → pipeline
    gate:
      first_frame: 1440p visible ≤ 16.6ms
      floor: 1440p144 p99≤6.944ms simple-rich scene
      parity: CPU reference pixdiff within ε

  §R2 substrate_PRISM
    goal: algebraic LoA rendering proprietary-native
    source: LoA.v13 specs/SUBSTRATE_v13.csl + specs/PRISM_v13.md
    primitives:
      quadric
      ellipsoid
      sphere
      cylinder
      box
      cone
      torus/quartic phase-b
      interval_CSG
    phases:
      PRISM.compute: CSSL compute closed-form intersections over SoA primitive buffers
      PRISM.rtquery: CSSL ray-query abstraction over hardware RT where available
      PRISM.intersection_shader: CSSL @intersect/@closesthit path
      PRISM.gi: radiance-cascade/ReSTIR opt-in after p99 stable
    W! hardware RT = accelerator, not design dependency
    W! compute fallback identical semantics
    gate:
      simple_quadric_scene: GPU p99≤6.944ms @1440p
      1000 primitive AABB culled scene: GPU util↑, CPU util bounded
      CPU/GPU hit t/material parity ε≤1e-4

  §R3 substrate_VM
    goal: data-as-renderer without Odin op table
    source: v14 op_table.odin + SUBSTRATE_BYTECODE_VM.md semantics
    W! canonical op table becomes CSSL source
    W! bytecode encoder/decoder in CSSL
    W! VM evaluator in CSSL CPU+GPU targets
    limits:
      ops_per_region: ≤2048
      bytes_per_region: ≤32KB
      recursion_depth: ≤2
      frame_stack: ≤8
    gate:
      256 sample parity CPU/GPU ✓
      invalid op fails closed ✓
      region budget violation diagnosed ✓

  §R4 competitive_render_features
    needs:
      skeletal animation GPU skinning
      projectiles/trails/particles GPU simulation
      decals + damage marks
      shadow maps/cascades
      screen-space contact shadows
      temporal AA with low-latency mode
      VRS tier2/foveated optional
      debug overlays zero-cost when disabled
    W! visual richness never steals sim determinism

§ CPU_GPU_RAM_UTILIZATION
  CPU:
    W! CSSL job system: work-stealing queues + fibers/tasks + frame graph dependencies
    W! SIMD math: vec/mat/quat first-class + AVX2/AVX512 backend
    W! gameplay fixed-step decoupled from render interpolation
    W! asset IO/decompression async
    W! physics broadphase parallel
    W! CPU hot paths SoA/archetype layouts

  GPU:
    W! queues: graphics + compute + copy exposed as typed resources
    W! async compute for particles, culling, light tiles, substrate prepass
    W! indirect dispatch/draw generated by GPU cull
    W! subgroup ops for reductions/prefix/cull
    W! persistent buffers/ring allocators
    R! work graphs/mesh shaders when backend support verified
    R! XMX path for denoise/upscale/ML only after deterministic render gates pass

  RAM_VRAM:
    W! gpu<T> = device-only
    W! shared<T, Coherent|WeakOrdered|NonCoherent> = explicit coherency
    W! staged<T> = upload/download transfer
    W! transfer<T> = copy-queue ownership
    W! barriers/semaphores required by type/effect system
    W! arenas: frame, level, streaming, scratch, gpu-upload
    W! texture/mesh/material streaming uses residency budget + LRU + prefetch
    W! ReBAR fast path ; fallback staged copies

§ COMPILER_LANGUAGE_WORK
  W! @gpu
  W! @compute
  W! @workgroup_size(x,y,z)
  W! @push_const
  W! @storage_buffer
  W! @storage_texture
  W! @uniform_buffer
  W! @shared_memory
  W! @barrier
  W! @raygen @miss @intersect @anyhit @closesthit
  W! if-expressions
  W! vec2/vec3/vec4 mat3/mat4 quat first-class
  W! fma/sqrt/rsqrt/sin/cos/noise intrinsics with CPU/GPU parity profile
  W! explicit layout: std140/std430/DXIL/Vulkan/HLSL compatible
  W! owned IR emit:
    SPIR-V
    DXIL
    WGSL only as debug/export backend, not engine dependency
    x64 native

§ HOST_WORK
  P0:
    fix csslc user-main link order via static archive wrapper
    D3D12 swapchain create_for_hwnd real path
    command buffer record/submit real path
    GPU fence/timeline semaphore
    storage texture create/bind/present blit
    raw input window pump

  P1:
    Vulkan parity path
    LevelZero telemetry/copy/compute optional path
    shader hot reload from CSSL source
    GPU crash breadcrumbs
    pixdiff framebuffer readback with async staging

  P2:
    remove wgpu/ash/windows-rs style semantics from public engine surface
    CSSL host ABI wrappers generated from owned definitions
    self-host runtime modules begin replacing bootstrap host crates

§ MIGRATION
  from.LoA_v13:
    keep:
      substrate.cssl closed-form math
      SUBSTRATE_v13.csl theory
      PRISM_v13.md RT plan
      CPU reference tests
    change:
      display.cssl CPU loop → gpu_display.cssl
      framebuffer DIB path → debug fallback only
      render_pixel arity mismatch → canonical signature
      reference.c → CSSL reference or generated oracle only
    delete_when_replaced:
      C shim math/display hot path

  from.LoA_v14:
    keep_as_oracle:
      primitive intersection formulas
      AABB/bucket cull evidence
      VM op taxonomy
      telemetry JSON schema
      perf thresholds
      scene6 validation lab semantics
    reauthor:
      clear_compute.wgsl → substrate_kernels.cssl
      op_table.odin → substrate_ops.cssl
      render.odin frame graph → render_graph.cssl
      scene.odin data layouts → scene_schema.cssl
    N! link/import/copy runtime Odin/WGSL as final system

  in.CSSLv3:
    promote:
      engine/render_forward.cssl from scaffold → real framegraph
      stdlib/gpu.cssl stubs → host-backed ops
      specs/65 GPU memory types → compiler enforced
      specs/76/77/78 → this CSSL-only invariant
    add:
      compiler tests for @gpu kernels
      golden pixel tests
      p99 perf harness
      CPU/GPU parity harness
      no-foreign-runtime audit

