    change:
      first crystal storage words now mean:
        word0 = strength byte
        word1 = biased x byte (`x_bias = clamp(x,-128,127)+128`)
        word2 = biased y byte
        word3 = reserved
      shader decodes x/y offset into ray-space:
        offset = ((word - 128) / 128) * 0.5
        dist = sqrt((dx_raw-offset_x)^2 + (dy_raw-offset_y)^2)
        influence = max(1 - dist*2, 0)
        emissive = strength_norm * 0.5 * influence
      headless crystal words = ⟨5,160,96,0⟩
      present path packs first `Crystal { x,y,strength_milli }` into same storage words
